      48.02,
      449.48,
      286.84,
      574.05
    ],
    "text": "Reference No.: KES/DS/LND/ACI/SAMURDI BANK. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose:- Public Purpose : - To acquire the land for the construction of Samurdhi Community Based Bank, Madapatha.",
