      48.02,
      573.59,
      286.72,
      647.99
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired : The land in total extent of 0.0269 hectare depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Sheet No. 05, Block No. 04 of the Cadastral Map 521208 situated in the Village of Batakettara North in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewa in Colombo District of the Western Province, described as follows.:",
