      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      302.47,
      523.67,
      541.92,
      598.17
    ],
    "text": "Moreover, they are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in two duplicates) before the 01st day of November, 2024 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the calculation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
